{"candidateAnswer":"Her grandmother, who stepped in with her savings to help the family through the difficult period.","evidence":"[D6:9 | 2:33 pm on 5 February, 2023] Maria: Thanks, John. When I was younger, we had some money problems and had to rely on outside help from out auntie. It was a tough learning experience about the importance of helping others who struggle.\n[D5:8 | 1:17 pm on 28 January, 2023] Maria: I started volunteering to help make a difference. My aunt believed in volunteering, and used to help my family out when we were struggling, so I'm inspired by her. It makes me happy knowing I can brighten somebody's day.","itemId":"urn:uuid:cf24d693-ca1a-5b1e-83d2-01925aea0939","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f2833ef4f970fb29792f2f7a2502c73d2b0c5a20bc7b92e9755ccc5e5a68a4c1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Who gave Maria's family money when she was younger and her family was going through tough times?","referenceAnswer":"Her aunt","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f2833ef4f970fb29792f2f7a2502c73d2b0c5a20bc7b92e9755ccc5e5a68a4c1"}}]}